WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
(pleasant music)

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.997
- Okay, so you've met
Sophia. You've met Michelle.

00:00:03.997 --> 00:00:04.830
- Hi.

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:05.760
- [Kelly] Bringing people together.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:06.772
- I am.
- [Kelly] Even the ones alive.

00:00:06.772 --> 00:00:08.460
(people laughing)

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.127
So, you've read thousands
of people over the years.

00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:10.960
- Yes.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.590
- Have you ever had one
that's just freaked you out?

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.510
- Not from people who have crossed over,

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.970
but from the living people
that I've actually read from.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:18.990
- That actually tracks.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.250
- Yeah, so, way back in the day,

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.660
I used to go to people's homes

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:22.950
and I would do like a house party.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.750
So, it was kinda like,
take out the Tupperware,

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.490
bring in the psychic kind of vibe.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:27.780
Yeah. So, I would be the person

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.400
they would shove in a
basement somewhere and then,

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.730
you know people would have
coffee and cake and...

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.550
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- I would read them.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.220
So, I had one night where I was completed.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.120
I thought I was done.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.430
And a woman said to me,
"No, you can't leave yet."

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.870
And I said, "Why can't I leave?"

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.450
And she goes, "We have a
very special guest coming."

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:43.297
And I'm like,

00:00:43.297 --> 00:00:45.720
"I don't think I really
have another reading in me."

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:46.710
And she said, "Oh no, no-

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:48.480
you have to have another reading in you."

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.980
And as she's saying that to me,

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.580
and she was very nervous,
like four SUVs pulled up.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:54.413
And I'm like,
- What?

00:00:54.413 --> 00:00:55.440
- Yeah, and I'm waiting for like,

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.000
somebody like, famous to get out?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.500
And there was nobody that I recognized

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.940
that was famous that got out.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:00.773
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:00.773 --> 00:01:02.310
- But somebody that they
knew, who was famous

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:03.776
and whatever circles they traveled

00:01:03.776 --> 00:01:06.168
got out with a lot of bodyguards.

00:01:06.168 --> 00:01:07.001
- Oh.

00:01:07.001 --> 00:01:09.870
- And that individual was
escorted down to the basement.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:13.080
I did a reading for said individual,

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.330
with six bodyguards in the room.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:17.100
- Like somebody in the mafia or something?

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:17.933
Like, what were we talking about?

00:01:17.933 --> 00:01:19.046
(group chattering)

00:01:19.046 --> 00:01:19.879
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.930
- I mean, how do you read that situation?

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:23.385
I would only give positive news.

00:01:23.385 --> 00:01:25.800
- I will tell you that, you would laugh

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:26.970
but for people who know me know

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:28.830
that my daughter calls me the
Gordon Ramsey of psychics.

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.650
So, like about 15 minutes into the reading

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:32.790
when he wasn't validating anything

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.980
I was like, "Dude. Like
you either have this

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.060
or you don't have this."

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:36.893
- Yeah.

00:01:36.893 --> 00:01:38.407
- And then all he said to me was,

00:01:38.407 --> 00:01:41.040
"So, the woman upstairs
has your information

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:42.480
and if ever I need to call upon you,

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.359
you will make yourself available."

00:01:44.359 --> 00:01:46.191
- You will make yourself- oh.

00:01:46.191 --> 00:01:47.130
- [John] That's what I was told.

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:48.711
Yeah. And I changed my
phone number after that.

00:01:48.711 --> 00:01:49.910
(people laughing)

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:51.990
- Was this like a sheikh or something?

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:53.070
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:54.066
- Or along the lines of what Kelly-

00:01:54.066 --> 00:01:56.820
- You will make yourself available.

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:58.080
It sounded like the mafia.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.730
- Yeah. It was not a
comfortable experience.

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:00.623
- [Michelle] That's gangster man.

00:02:00.623 --> 00:02:01.456
(group chattering)

00:02:01.456 --> 00:02:02.289
Oh, literally.

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:03.810
(Michelle laughs)

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.460
- Literally.

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:07.740
So, wait, how does your
family react to your ability?

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:09.840
Do they just go, "Don't read
me, don't read anything."

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:10.848
- I don't like to read
my family. I don't like-

00:02:10.848 --> 00:02:11.681
- [Kelly] Oh, yeah?

00:02:11.681 --> 00:02:13.260
- Yeah. I don't wanna
read people that I know

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:14.490
because then I know stuff about them that,

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:16.080
maybe I don't want to know.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.420
- Sometimes I have to see stuff
that I don't want to know.

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:19.410
- Yeah, I'm that person too.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.243
I don't need to know everything.

00:02:20.243 --> 00:02:22.067
I'm not that, I'm not curious like that.

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:23.910
- So, I've been doing
this for four decades.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.940
So, over the years you kind of learn like,

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:27.870
yeah, I don't wanna do that anymore.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:29.580
- You turn it on and off?

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.410
- You have to be able
to turn it on and off,

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:33.420
because if not, then you're walking around

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:36.270
energetically receptive
to other people's energies

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.970
and you don't want to take
on other people's stuff.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.800
- Do y'all have anything
that you wanna ask him?

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:41.633
I don't know.

00:02:41.633 --> 00:02:43.430
- Ooh...
- Uh...

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.818
(group laughs)

00:02:44.818 --> 00:02:47.134
- In front of all these wonderful people?

00:02:47.134 --> 00:02:49.165
- She said, "Uh..."

00:02:49.165 --> 00:02:51.960
- How did you get into it?

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:55.027
- So, I... that's a good question.

00:02:55.027 --> 00:02:56.010
- [Kelly] It is a good question.

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.320
- I actually went to debunk a psychic

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.420
that was doing readings
at my grandmother's house.

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:01.253
- Oh wow.

00:03:01.253 --> 00:03:03.570
- I wanted to prove to my
family that it wasn't real

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:06.090
and that she wouldn't
be able to read for me.

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:07.710
So, my mom said, I was 15,

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:09.124
my mom said I was allowed to go as long

00:03:09.124 --> 00:03:11.190
as I treated the woman with respect.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.270
I was all, "I'll treat her with respect,

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:13.320
but I ain't helping her."

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:17.526
And I was blown away. She changed my life.

00:03:17.526 --> 00:03:18.690
- Wow.

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.250
- She literally, she told
me I had this ability.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:22.320
The reason why she was there
that day was put me on my path.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.840
And I, I thought she was kind of crazy.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:27.420
But it was a... I didn't
love it, to be honest.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:28.980
I know it sounds crazy,
but I always tell people

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:33.030
if you're not ready for a
real reading, do not go.

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:35.370
Because I was not ready
for a real experience

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.080
and I felt violated.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.840
So, my development came
as a result of wanting

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:42.420
to make sure nobody else could
ever do that to me again.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.890
- It must be really hard too,

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.774
living in a scientific world, you know?

00:03:45.774 --> 00:03:46.607
- Yeah.

00:03:46.607 --> 00:03:47.730
- I mean we've fought so hard,

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:49.500
I think especially in America,

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.210
to separate church from state

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:55.770
and to have the liberty of
being able to prove things,

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:57.060
true or false.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:59.610
And the proof in the
pudding is kind of like...

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:00.450
- [John] And that's, that's why-

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.770
- This generation, you know.

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:04.170
- For me I was very, I was very blessed.

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.120
I had the opportunity to go
to the University of Arizona

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.100
and be studied with Dr. Gary Schwartz,

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.900
and he wrote a book called
The Afterlife Experiments.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:11.760
And myself and another,
a number of mediums

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:12.990
have gone out there three or four times.

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:14.820
And in science, you have to replicate

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.380
and extend data, right?

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.970
To show the validity, to rule out

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:20.550
that you're reading body
language and facial cues.

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:21.990
And we did all of that.

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:24.390
But, I adopted that in my practice

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:25.770
because I want people to recognize

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:28.110
that it's important in
our society right now

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.550
to be a critical thinker.

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:31.680
And just because somebody
says to think this way

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.450
or feel this way, or believe this way,

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:36.480
whether it be pastor,
teacher or politician,

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:38.850
always makes sure you're questioning

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:41.520
and thinking about the validity
of what they're saying.

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:42.630
And more importantly,

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:43.557
where is their intention coming from?

00:04:43.557 --> 00:04:45.180
- Yeah. What's the motivation?

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.710
- Yeah, are they trying to empower you

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:47.760
or are they trying to control you?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:48.810
- Yeah.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:49.809
- [Kelly] Wow. Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:49.809 --> 00:04:52.042
(people clapping)

00:04:52.042 --> 00:04:54.150
I think that's actually pretty cool

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:56.339
because you actually love
that people question you.

00:04:56.339 --> 00:04:57.690
- [John] ] I do.
- Yeah. I love that.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:58.560
- [John] I like validation.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.030
So, like sometimes,
somebody will come to me

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:02.610
because they desperately
want to hear from one person.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.410
And I wind up connecting with four others,

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:06.180
and sometimes I have to
connect with four others

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:07.470
before I can get to the one person

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:08.460
that they want to hear from.

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.680
So, I always feel like
I'm your psychic dog.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.330
I'm like, when the dog
does the thing right,

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.170
you give him a treat.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:14.610
And for me, the treat is validation.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:15.540
- Yeah.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.960
Have you ever picked up
on something that like...

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.040
the person didn't want to,

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.510
you didn't necessarily ask,

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:22.547
but you felt inclined,
you had to say something?

00:05:22.547 --> 00:05:23.850
- Oh, it just happened last week.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.940
I was in Detroit and I
wound up reading for a woman

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:28.500
who was with her mother-in-law,

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.090
and their family came
through and announced

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.500
that she was pregnant.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:34.110
And she had this like
moment of being like...

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:35.730
and then she's like,
"She doesn't know yet!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:36.690
This is my mother-in-law."

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:38.370
And she was like, "Yes, it's true."

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:39.526
So like, moments like that happened.

00:05:39.526 --> 00:05:41.310
- [Kelly] Oh wow.
- Yeah.

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.870
- For people who can't see you in person,

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:43.890
you have another way to connect.

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:45.180
That's pretty cool. So, what is it?

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:46.740
- I do, so if folks are interested

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:48.540
in the subject matter, not
only am I going on tour

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:51.930
but I am just launching
an online community.

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.210
So, they can go to johnedward.net.

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:56.220
- Okay. So you, when you go on tour

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:57.840
that's a huge room filled with people.

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:00.450
That's not overwhelming, that many people?

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:02.460
- No, the the most
overwhelmed I could ever say

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.700
that I was, I did an
arena tour in Australia.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:06.533
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:06:06.533 --> 00:06:07.366
- And they were like, well you would know.

00:06:07.366 --> 00:06:08.199
I, I mean like that-

00:06:08.199 --> 00:06:09.032
- [Kelly] No, I mean, I get it.

00:06:09.032 --> 00:06:10.260
If I'm just projecting something out,

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.090
I'm not necessarily- and I
guess I am receiving too,

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:13.260
like energy from the audience.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.150
But that's, that could be overwhelming.

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:17.010
Like just pending on
what's happening. You know?

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:18.120
- It was when I walked out there

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.680
in front of like, you know, 7,000 people.

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:21.270
- I was like, what am I gonna do?

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.260
And then I realized it didn't matter

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:23.760
if it was 7,000 or seven,

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:24.960
the people who were
supposed to get the message

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:25.890
were going to get the message

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.338
and I was gonna do my job as best I can.

00:06:27.338 --> 00:06:28.171
- You had to let go and be your best self.

00:06:28.171 --> 00:06:29.790
- And then educate and
empower the other people

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:30.990
that were there to hear.

